ame": "screenshot_01_hero.png", "id": "2617784765319965", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293690_2617784768653298_3560185570484911980_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pLeYGPNRzhsQ7kNvwFaD9OJ&_nc_oc=AdoCQF6jeBdUtG4OzI7TixFbfVS_Q3c0x_y6lfdfUSdCRk8w2nosbgDKsHPgAIC8m1I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTnqPhmNXBuaWnnvvFQGM8CsXdw_b__tZ2KQl4GZF7hpQ&oe=6AFDBFB0"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_04_combate.png", "id": "836852862807508", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298137_836852866140841_7395582496335751672_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7d-3sIB9bLUQ7kNvwEMiWo3&_nc_oc=Adop2FttIyu3oI9eiiwurf8y3NmhxyaU1-vCm6922MYuXlxW9ZUCHd8U1ZQGjXH9kos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTK5UIPfaum915G6HOdLD54YPaFTe0jw9Pmdz9dZMe1Pw&oe=6AFDB9E9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_05_misiles.png", "id": "1394594965639549", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292712_1394594968972882_7986866598630709564_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wazSNt6itqwQ7kNvwHGMqDI&_nc_oc=AdrnrQaHVFp_C0kf2RgEB3_nOVVGNcugpXGQIbZwTmc7NzjfytsavCP5i3tGWjq9eOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQT_KGdiRRf7khxh507ykoPznN0gvta8V2pqc6ekbNriw&oe=6AFDC0DF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1726812238424776", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299745_1726812241758109_2694926036620651287_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sJBBITNRHj4Q7kNvwHcX3EH&_nc_oc=AdoQdj_BfPaEQzCTwr6pSmpiZocqlQRhPEi-oHNmLbTqmoogpO-ATSZ2ne5Enx7G0l0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQo8jWxqo_Xl_FlIcSBDyNfyIa5rijAMFLMs_f4fjHwng&oe=6AFDC643"}, "display_name": "LUXURY ASSAULT VR", "keywords": ["vehicle", "boat", "shooter", "yatch"], "long_description": "Take the helm of an armed superyacht and fight your way through twelve missions on open water.\n\nThis is not a thumbstick game. You reach out, close your fist around the actual wheel of the boat,\nand turn it \u2014 and the hull answers. Your other hand finds the throttle lever, pushes it to the stop,\nand you feel the bow lift. The bow minigun tracks wherever you look, so you line up an enemy boat\nwith your eyes and squeeze the trigger. Missiles are one press away.\n\nTWELVE MISSIONS, IN ORDER\nLearn the helm on a run between three buoys, then hunt your first target, launch off a ramp at full\nthrottle, race a clock through a buoy course, level a building with missiles, hold out for ninety\nseconds under fire from four boats, and finish as the last hull standing against eight. Every mission\nis scored on time, awards up to three stars, and remembers your best run. Progress is saved on your\nheadset \u2014 no account, no sign-in.\n\nBUILT FOR THE HEADSET\nThe game asks the display for 120 Hz and holds it, with fixed foveated rendering and a frame-time\nguard that protects the refresh rate rather than an average. The sea is a custom shader: six octaves\nof analytic swell, real sun glitter, and your own hull's shadow across it. Seated play throughout,\nwith an adjustable comfort vignette and quality presets in the settings.\n\nSIX LANGUAGES\nEnglish, Spanish, Portuguese, French, German and Italian, switchable at any time.\n\nNOTHING LEAVES YOUR HEADSET\nNo account, no analytics, no advertising, no tracking. T", "short_description": "Grab the wheel. Push the throttle. A stolen superyacht, twelve missions, one sea.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.claude.ai/artifact/Ez25zV3gNKjHUBHDzmZd8J", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Francisco Manuel Mier y Teran Almazan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://claude.ai/artifact/Ez25zV3